Subject: [PATCH] Fix incorrect ticket locking area while calling setSource on
 propagator in addTicketAtLevel

Moonrise just locked improperly?
See the comments on setSource in ThreadedTicketPropagator
and the implementation of addTicketAtLevel on the original ChunkHolderManager

